#. Tag: title
#: man-kjscmd.1.docbook:37
#, no-c-format
msgid "Synopsis"
msgstr "Sinopsis"

#. Tag: cmdsynopsis
#: man-kjscmd.1.docbook:39
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<command>kjscmd</command> <arg choice=\"opt\">--help</arg> <group> <arg "
"choice=\"opt\">-e</arg> <arg choice=\"opt\">--exec</arg> </group> <group> "
"<arg choice=\"opt\">-i</arg> <arg choice=\"opt\">-interactive</arg> </group> "
"<group> <arg choice=\"opt\">-n</arg> <arg choice=\"opt\">-no-kde</arg> </"
"group> <arg choice=\"opt\">file</arg>"
msgstr ""
"<command>kjscmd</command> <arg choice=\"opt\">--help</arg> <group> <arg "
"choice=\"opt\">-e</arg> <arg choice=\"opt\">--exec</arg> </group> <group> "
"<arg choice=\"opt\">-i</arg> <arg choice=\"opt\">-interactive</arg> </group> "
"<group> <arg choice=\"opt\">-n</arg> <arg choice=\"opt\">-no-kde</arg> </"
"group> <arg choice=\"opt\">file</arg>"

#. Tag: title
#: man-kjscmd.1.docbook:65
#, no-c-format
msgid "Description"
msgstr "Opis"

#. Tag: para
#: man-kjscmd.1.docbook:67
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<command>kjscmd</command> is a tool for launching KJSEmbed scripts from the "
"command line. It will run the scripts contained in the named "
"<parameter>file</parameter> using KJSEmbed. It does not accept - (stdin) as "
"a <parameter>file</parameter>."
msgstr ""
"<command>kjscmd</command> je alaz za pokretanje KJSEmbed skripte iz komandne "
"linije. Pokrenut će skriptu sadržanu u  <parameter>file</parameter> "
"koristeći KJSEmbed. Ne prihvata - (stdin) kao <parameter>file</parameter>."

#. Tag: title
#: man-kjscmd.1.docbook:149
#, no-c-format
msgid "Application Options"
msgstr "Opcije programa"

#. Tag: term
#: man-kjscmd.1.docbook:153
#, no-c-format
msgid "<option>-e</option>,<option>--exec</option>"
msgstr "<option>-e</option>,<option>--exec</option>"

#. Tag: para
#: man-kjscmd.1.docbook:155
#, no-c-format
msgid "execute script in <parameter>file</parameter> without gui support."
msgstr "izvrši skriptu u <parameter>file</parameter> bez GUI podrške."

#. Tag: term
#: man-kjscmd.1.docbook:162
#, no-c-format
msgid "<option>-i</option>,<option>--interactive</option>"
msgstr "<option>-i</option>,<option>--interactive</option>"

#. Tag: para
#: man-kjscmd.1.docbook:164
#, no-c-format
msgid "start interactive <command>kjs</command> interpreter."
msgstr "započni interaktivni  <command>kjs</command> prevod."

#. Tag: term
#: man-kjscmd.1.docbook:169
#, no-c-format
msgid "<option>-n</option>,<option>--no-kde</option>"
msgstr "<option>-n</option>,<option>--no-kde</option>"

#. Tag: para
#: man-kjscmd.1.docbook:171
#, no-c-format
msgid "start without &kde; KApplication support."
msgstr "započeti bez &kde; KApplication podrške."

#. Tag: title
#: man-kjscmd.1.docbook:181
#, no-c-format
msgid "Usage"
msgstr "Upotreba"

#. Tag: para
#: man-kjscmd.1.docbook:182
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The most common way to run <command>kjscmd</command> is simply as "
"<literallayout>\n"
"<userinput><command>kjscmd</command> <parameter>file</parameter>\n"
"</userinput>\n"
"</literallayout> If no parameter <parameter>file</parameter> is used, it "
"executes a predefined test script that measures the start speed of "
"<command>kjscmd</command>."
msgstr ""
"Najbolji način da se pokrene <command>kjscmd</command> je <literallayout>\n"
"<userinput><command>kjscmd</command> <parameter>file</parameter>\n"
"</userinput>\n"
"</literallayout> If no parameter <parameter>file</parameter> je korišten, da "
"izvršava unaprijed definirane test skripte koje mjere brzinu "
"<command>kjscmd</command>."

